  "term": "PCC",
  "definition": "PCC stands for problematic caffeine consumption. In this context, it means a pattern of caffeine use, often discussed alongside adolescent gaming, that is linked with negative consequences and may be reinforced by social, marketing, and neurocognitive influences.",
